or just

docker-compose run --rm test-run mvn clean test "-Dgroups=one, two, api" "-Denv=docker" "-Dplatform=web" "-Dselenide.browser=chrome"

new allure

- remove old tests html files in allure-results + remove allure-report folder
mvn test "-Dgroups=one, two" "-Denv=local" "-Dplatform=web" "-Dselenide.browser=chrome"
allure generate target/allure-results OR allure generate target/allure-results -o target/allure-report
- move history folder from allure-report to allure-results
allure serve target/allure-results



